        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Circle, 12 Angry Men, Mission Control, Major Crimes, iZombie\n- People: Reginald Rose, Sidney Lumet, Mercy Malick\n- Topics: film inspiration, production, plot, notable works\n\nFacts:\n- The 1957 film 12 Angry Men was written and co-produced by Reginald Rose and directed by Sidney Lumet.\n- The 1957 film 12 Angry Men is a trial film about a jury of 12 men deliberating a defendant's guilt or acquittal based on reasonable doubt.\n- The 2015 film Circle was inspired by the 1957 drama 12 Angry Men.\n- The 2015 film Circle was shot in 2014.\n- Mercy Malick is best known for Mission Control, Major Crimes, Circle, and iZombie.",
